{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测异常过大的DNS响应。对应需求：横向移动。官方：Abnormally Large DNS Response。","index":["logs-network_traffic.*","logs-panw.panos*","logs-zeek.*","logs-corelight.*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】异常过大的DNS响应","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n异常过大的DNS响应\n\n### 为何重要\n向其他主机扩散\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://research.checkpoint.com/2020/resolving-your-way-into-domain-admin-exploiting-a-17-year-old-bug-in-windows-dns-servers/","https://msrc-blog.microsoft.com/2020/07/14/july-2020-security-update-cve-2020-1350-vulnerability-in-windows-domain-name-system-dns-server/","https://github.com/maxpl0it/CVE-2020-1350-DoS","https://www.elastic.co/security-labs/detection-rules-for-sigred-vulnerability"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"11013227-0301-4a8c-b150-4db924484475","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 横向移动","来源: 默认","对应需求: 横向移动"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"((event.category:(network or network_traffic) and destination.port:53) \n      or network.protocol:\"dns\" \n      or data_stream.dataset:(network_traffic.dns or zeek.dns)\n      or (event.module:corelight and event.dataset:dns))\n    and destination.bytes >= 65000\n    and event.type:(\"allowed\" or \"end\" or \"protocol\" or \"start\")\nand not (\n  event.duration > 60000000000\n  and (\n    event.action:(\"flow_terminated\" or \"network_flow\")\n    or data_stream.dataset:zeek.connection\n    or (event.module:corelight and event.dataset:conn)\n  )\n)\n","alert_suppression":{"group_by":["source.ip","destination.ip"],"missing_fields_strategy":"doNotSuppress","duration":{"unit":"h","value":1}},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1210","name":"Exploitation of Remote Services","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1210/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0008","name":"Lateral Movement","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0008/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1499","name":"Endpoint Denial of Service","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1499/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1499.004","name":"Application or System Exploitation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1499/004/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"from":"now-9m","interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"},{"package":"panw","version":"*"},{"package":"zeek","version":"*"},{"package":"corelight","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":114,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
